@startuml F3.8-ERRO-publish-scope
title F3.8-ERRO — 403 FGAC / 422 audiência fora de scope
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CommunicationController" as Ctrl
participant "PublishCommunicationUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

== Cenário A — 403 ==
Prof -> WebApp: /comunicacao/publicar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /communications
note right of Jwt
  communication.publish_class
  ausente
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403

== Cenário B — 422 ==
Prof -> WebApp: Publicar audiência adulterada
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /communications
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: valida vínculo\nprofessor ↔ audiência
Postgres --> UC: fora de scope
UC --> Ctrl: erro
Ctrl --> WebApp: 422

@enduml
